OL,3,GNEWSADawn arrest to 'descent into
OL,4,Adisgrace': How victims exposed Jeffrey
OL,5,ADonaldson's lies
OL,6,
OL,7,FIt was dawn on 28 March 2024 when the
OL,8,Fpolice pulled up at a house off a
OL,9,Fcountry road to arrest one of Northern
OL,10,FIreland's most powerful men.
OL,12,FTheir investigation had begun earlier
OL,13,Fthat month when two women entered a
OL,14,Fpolice station and told officers they
OL,15,Fhad been abused as children by Jeffrey
OL,16,FDonaldson, MP and leader of the
OL,17,FDemocratic Unionist Party (DUP).
OL,23,APub: 15-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB NI NewsC Reg TVF On This Day
FL,416,410,260,120,0,100
