OL,2,W//%*// //%Q%* ** %-,*,$%** %-& (,,,,,,,
OL,3,GNEWSADawn arrest to 'descent into
OL,4,Adisgrace': How victims exposed Jeffrey
OL,5,ADonaldson's lies
OL,6,
OL,7,FHe was a politician at the height of
OL,8,Fhis power, a man toasted in Washington
OL,9,FDC for his role in restoring
OL,10,Fpower-sharing government in Northern
OL,11,FIreland just days before the police
OL,12,Farrived at his door.
OL,14,FDonaldson was arrested, charged and
OL,15,Fultimately convicted on 18 charges,
OL,16,Fincluding one of rape. On Thursday, his
OL,17,F"catastrophic descent into disgrace",
OL,18,Fas the judge put it, was complete when
OL,19,Fhe was sentenced to 15 years in prison.
OL,23,APub: 15-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG2/2
